'''Cookie Clicker''' was a minigame where players repeatedly click a Cookie. 

== Mechanics ==
The game could be accessed from the [[Booster Cookie/UI|Booster Cookie interface]]. Starting the game would open an interface with a cookie in the middle. Clicking the cookie would add 1 to the player's cookie count. Occasionally, an enchanted cookie would appear that gave a random number of cookies.<ref>https://imgur.com/a/kRp2s6l</ref> A leaderboard could be viewed at the {{Item|Milk Bucket}}. Viewing the leaderboard required 1,000 cookies.

